WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.357 --> 00:00:10.591
IN THE CITY OF SAN FRANCISCO,

00:00:10.592 --> 00:00:12.827
ONE OF THE PRETTIEST PLACES IN

00:00:12.828 --> 00:00:13.561
THE UNITED STATES, LAW AND ORDER

00:00:13.562 --> 00:00:16.964
HAS BEEN EFFECTIVELY SUSPENDED

00:00:16.965 --> 00:00:21.903
THANKS TO LEFT-WING PROSECUTORS.

00:00:21.904 --> 00:00:24.505
PEOPLE CAMP ON THE SIDEWALKS, IN

00:00:24.506 --> 00:00:27.074
PUBLIC, USE DRUGS IN BROAD

00:00:27.075 --> 00:00:27.975
DAYLIGHT, ALL WITHOUT PENALTY.

00:00:27.976 --> 00:00:34.248
THAT'S BAD ENOUGH.

00:00:34.249 --> 00:00:44.292
FOR PART TWO OF OUR WEEK LONG --

00:00:44.293 --> 00:00:44.926
CUSTOMERS CAN STEAL WITH

00:00:44.927 --> 00:00:45.293
IMPUNITY.

00:00:45.294 --> 00:00:49.964
HERE'S THE CONVERSATION.

00:00:49.965 --> 00:00:50.831
[BLEEP] [BLEEP] &gt;&gt; THIS IS A DAY

00:00:50.832 --> 00:00:53.334
IN THE LIFE OF --

00:00:53.335 --> 00:01:02.543
&gt;&gt; I'VE BEEN HERE 42 YEARS.

00:01:02.544 --> 00:01:08.082
HE RUNS A GROCERY STORE.

00:01:08.083 --> 00:01:09.750
HOW OFTEN DO PEOPLE COME IN AND

00:01:09.751 --> 00:01:11.085
CREATE PROBLEMS IN THE STORE

00:01:11.086 --> 00:01:13.354
CUSTOMER &gt;&gt; EVERY DAY.

00:01:13.355 --> 00:01:13.888
EVERY SINGLE DAY.

00:01:13.889 --> 00:01:15.723
&gt;&gt; IT'S NOT AN EXAGGERATION.

00:01:15.724 --> 00:01:17.491
CUSTOMERS WERE PICKING UP

00:01:17.492 --> 00:01:20.695
POCKETS WITH MERCHANDISE AND

00:01:20.696 --> 00:01:24.165
WALKING OUT OF THE STORE.

00:01:24.166 --> 00:01:26.100
&gt;&gt; IT HAPPENS EVERY FEW MINUTES.

00:01:26.101 --> 00:01:28.936
LITERALLY IN OUR STORE, PROBABLY

00:01:28.937 --> 00:01:30.237
15-20 TIMES A DAY.

00:01:30.238 --> 00:01:30.972
&gt;&gt; 20 TIMES A DAY?

00:01:30.973 --> 00:01:35.076
&gt;&gt; OH, YEAH.

00:01:35.077 --> 00:01:35.610
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THE

00:01:35.611 --> 00:01:36.344
DECRIMINALIZATION OF CRIME HAS

00:01:36.345 --> 00:01:39.747
BEEN A DISASTER.

00:01:39.748 --> 00:01:42.149
&gt;&gt; ONE WAS THE LAST TIME YOU

00:01:42.150 --> 00:01:43.651
CAME INTO WORK AND HAD A DAY

00:01:43.652 --> 00:01:44.352
WHERE NOTHING WENT WRONG?

00:01:44.353 --> 00:01:47.521
&gt;&gt; IT'S BEEN MANY YEARS.

00:01:47.522 --> 00:01:49.090
&gt;&gt; Tucker: HE IS BEEN ATTACKED

00:01:49.091 --> 00:01:50.891
BY THE HOMELESS TWICE IN HIS OWN

00:01:50.892 --> 00:01:51.192
STORE.

00:01:51.193 --> 00:01:52.193
ONE WOMAN BIT HIM WHEN HE ASKED

00:01:52.194 --> 00:01:54.295
HER TO LEAVE.

00:01:54.296 --> 00:01:58.532
&gt;&gt; SHE BIT INTO MY ARM.

00:01:58.533 --> 00:02:01.602
I FREAKED OUT.

00:02:01.603 --> 00:02:03.571
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THOSE WHO CALL ON

00:02:03.572 --> 00:02:05.539
THE LAW ARE HELPLESS WHILE

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:06.340
CRIMINALS REIGNED SUPREME.

00:02:06.341 --> 00:02:07.608
THIS FOOTAGE SHOWS A MAN RAKING

00:02:07.609 --> 00:02:11.112
INTO THE STORE.

00:02:11.113 --> 00:02:16.350
&gt;&gt; HE RANG UP $30,000 WORTH

00:02:16.351 --> 00:02:19.387
OF --

00:02:19.388 --> 00:02:21.188
&gt;&gt; HOW OFTEN DO YOU SEE PEOPLE

00:02:21.189 --> 00:02:23.090
DOING DRUGS?

00:02:23.091 --> 00:02:26.394
&gt;&gt; OH, MY --

00:02:26.395 --> 00:02:26.961
&gt;&gt; Tucker: SOMEONE HAD

00:02:26.962 --> 00:02:28.796
ATTEMPTED TO STEAL SOME OF THE

00:02:28.797 --> 00:02:30.631
COUNTERFEIT MONEY THAT HE TAPES

00:02:30.632 --> 00:02:32.733
TO THE WALL BEHIND THE CASH

00:02:32.734 --> 00:02:33.467
REGISTER.

00:02:33.468 --> 00:02:35.069
&gt;&gt; THIS IS LOW-INCOME HOUSING

00:02:35.070 --> 00:02:36.303
AND SOME OF THEM HAVE ISSUES.

00:02:36.304 --> 00:02:38.305
SOMETIMES THEY PASS OUT.

00:02:38.306 --> 00:02:40.141
WATER PENETRATES THE CEILING.

00:02:40.142 --> 00:02:41.575
IT HAPPENS EVERY MONTH PRETTY

00:02:41.576 --> 00:02:41.876
MUCH.

00:02:41.877 --> 00:02:43.110
&gt;&gt; Tucker: HOW MUCH YOU PAY IN

00:02:43.111 --> 00:02:44.178
TAXES EVERY YEAR?

00:02:44.179 --> 00:02:45.713
&gt;&gt; THOUSANDS.

00:02:45.714 --> 00:02:47.348
HUNDREDS OF THOUSAND DOLLARS.

00:02:47.349 --> 00:02:49.116
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WHY ARE YOU STILL

00:02:49.117 --> 00:02:49.750
IN SAN FRANCISCO?

00:02:49.751 --> 00:02:51.919
&gt;&gt; WELL, BECAUSE YOU MAKE

00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:52.687
INVESTMENTS IN BUSINESSES.

00:02:52.688 --> 00:02:55.756
YOU CAN'T JUST PICK UP AND LEAV

00:02:55.757 --> 00:02:56.057
LEAVE.

00:02:56.058 --> 00:02:57.491
&gt;&gt; I LIVE A BLOCK AWAY.

00:02:57.492 --> 00:03:02.296
[BLEEP] YOU!

00:03:02.297 --> 00:03:05.599
&gt;&gt; HE WAS ON THE PHONE WITH THE

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:07.768
POLICE DEPARTMENT.

00:03:07.769 --> 00:03:09.503
&gt;&gt; YOU HAVE ANGRY PEOPLE ACROSS

00:03:09.504 --> 00:03:10.438
THE STREET WHO CAN'T AFFORD IT

00:03:10.439 --> 00:03:13.040
BECAUSE THEY ARE LEAVING

00:03:13.041 --> 00:03:13.074
BECAUSE THEY ARE LIVVING

00:03:13.075 --> 00:03:13.107
BECAUSE THEY ARE LIVINNG

00:03:13.108 --> 00:03:15.209
BECAUSE THEY ARE LIVING IN

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:15.543
POVERTY.

00:03:15.544 --> 00:03:19.514
I'M SCARED FOR MY SAFETY.

